SurvPT 0.2.0

* PT EM updates now integrate the selected conditional base distribution in
  each terminal interval, using the same probability calculation as the
  returned survival function. Exponential and Weibull leaves no longer use
  uniform overlap fractions during EM updates.
* Uniform leaves with an infinite right endpoint use the same finite tail
  cutoff in EM updates and output. Exponential and Weibull tails remain
  unbounded. OPT behavior is unchanged.
* Add regression tests for conditional allocations, output distributions,
  finite and infinite supports, tail behavior, and probability conservation.
* Expand English installation, usage, method, limitation, and developer guides;
  document all exported functions and add a small runnable quickstart.
* Add verified OPT citations to the guides, function help, R citation metadata,
  and CITATION.cff. Clarify the univariate scope of the current OPT interface.
* Replace the license placeholder with a private-repository permission-status
  notice. No software license or redistribution permission is granted.
